#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/wifi_espc201/06-iot_Remote_relay_controller.rst:57
msgid "The template and the device were created once in :ref:`c201_iot_blynk_start`. Every project adds its datastreams to that **same** template, so each project occupies its own range of virtual pins. This project uses **V7**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/wifi_espc201/06-iot_Remote_relay_controller.rst:61
msgid "**What this project sends to the cloud**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/wifi_espc201/06-iot_Remote_relay_controller.rst:63
msgid "One integer, ``relay_status``. It is not a sensor reading: it mirrors the state of the relay, so the app and the board always agree on whether the relay is on."
msgstr ""

